# RL Circuit - Current Response
# First Order System
#
# Circuit: voltage source -> R -> L -> ground
# Output: current i(p)
#
# H(p) = (1/R) / (1 + (L/R)*p)
#
# R = 10 ohms, L = 0.5 H
# K = 1/R = 0.1 A/V, tau = L/R = 0.05 s
#
# Numerator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
: 0.1
# Denominator coefficients (ascending powers of p)
:: 1 0.05
